[03:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'this workflow up and make creating workflows from scratch much easier because it automatically wires whatever you hook up into it. It\'s called anything everywhere from the CG use everywhere node pack. And here\'s all it does. You take an output, any output for'

[03:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'example, our model from our load diffusion model and just put it into the node. Let\'s also take our clip and put it into anything everywhere and our VAE. If you\'re someone who enjoys creating'

