[03:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'corresponding to whatever you put into anything anywhere gets that connection wirelessly. So, not only do you not have to drag all of your outputs from your VAE loader, your clip loader, your model loader, whatever you hook up into'

[03:58] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: ComfyUI workflow with "Anything Everywhere" node highlighted.
AUDIO: 'anything everywhere, but it\'ll also just clean up the entire noodleness of this workflow. So, I\'m going to unwire everything that takes one of these inputs, and I\'m going to show you guys how much cleaner this'

[04:11] [scene:talk]
