AUDIO: 'workflow looks without all of these wires just going all over the place. So, after just a few seconds, you guys can really see how much the workflow has been cleaned up. And if you still need to see where your wirings are coming from or where they\'re going to, that\'s no problem at all. All you need to do is'

[04:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
