[08:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'second I found it, I spent literally three hours playing around with it and changing every single last variable. Writing character prompts is tedious. You sit there typing out skin tone, body type, hair color, eye color, outfit, age, ethnicity, etc., etc. By the time'

[08:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you\'ve written a prompt detailed enough to actually get consistently good results, you spent 10 minutes on a text box and then you want to change one thing and you\'re rewriting half of it. And Identity Forge completely eliminates'

